abstract: >-
  Guardian F401 is an experimental STM32F401CDU6 embedded research platform
  combining deterministic signal acquisition, DSP and spectral analysis,
  machine-health state evaluation, supervisory control, authenticated command
  handling, robustness testing, and a portable signed-firmware lifecycle. It
  investigates a trust boundary in which analytics and future AI components
  provide recommendations while deterministic policy retains operational
  authority. Software and local Keil compilation milestones are documented;
  physical board qualification and safety certification are not claimed.
